# Cloudflare Pages redirects. Copied verbatim into out/ at build time.
#
# The Shopify site that served mushi.agency until the cutover had three real
# URLs; this site is a single "/" route, so without these they 404 and the
# accumulated links rot. Templates now live in the webapp, so that one leaves
# the site entirely rather than dumping the visitor on the home page.
/pages/waitlist    /                                  301
/blogs/news        /                                  301
/pages/templates   https://app.mushi.agency/templates 301
# The site's own address for a call (CALL_PATH, src/lib/site.ts), sent on to
# the scheduler for now — 302, so the address stays ours when it moves.
/call              https://calendly.com/mushiagency/call 302
